## This program creates a graph charting the amount of cryofluid, water, titanium, and blast compound stored in various containers, creating a visual indicator if there's a problem that could shut down your impact reactor(s).
op add graphX graphX 1
sensor cryo tank1 @cryofluid
op div cryoGraphY cryo 18.5
sensor water tank2 @water
op div waterGraphY water 18.5
sensor blast container1 @blast-compound
op div blastGraphY blast 3.75
sensor tita container2 @titanium
op div titaGraphY tita 3.75
draw color 63 63 63 255 0 0
draw line graphX 0 graphX 81 0 0
draw color 0 255 255 255 0 0
draw line graphX cryoGraphY graphX 1 0 0
drawflush display1
draw color 63 63 63 255 0 0
draw line graphX 0 graphX 81 0 0
draw color 0 0 255 255 0 0
draw line graphX waterGraphY graphX 1 0 0
drawflush display2
draw color 63 63 63 255 0 0
draw line graphX 0 graphX 81 0 0
draw color 255 0 0 255 0 0
draw line graphX blastGraphY graphX 1 0 0
drawflush display3
draw color 63 63 63 255 0 0
draw line graphX 0 graphX 81 0 0
draw color 191 255 255 255 0 0
draw line graphX titaGraphY graphX 1 0 0
drawflush display4
op mod graphX graphX 80

